flowchart TB
    Client[Brand application] --> GW[API gateway: verifies token, derives tenant]
    GW --> Salt[Sets per-tenant cache_salt and adapter name]
    subgraph Shared[Shared: no tenant data]
        Base[Base model weights: public, licensed or synthetic data only]
        Serve[Inference server]
        Base --> Serve
    end
    Salt --> Serve
    subgraph TA[Tenant A boundary]
        KA[Key A] --- SA[(Encrypted store A)]
        SA --- RA[(Retrieval index A)]
        RA --- AA[Adapter A versions]
    end
    subgraph TB2[Tenant B boundary]
        KB[Key B] --- SB[(Encrypted store B)]
        SB --- RB[(Retrieval index B)]
        RB --- AB[Adapter B versions]
    end
    Serve -. loads only token's adapter .-> AA
    Serve -. loads only token's adapter .-> AB
    GW -. tenant-scoped retrieval .-> RA
    GW -. tenant-scoped retrieval .-> RB
    Ops[Operators] --> Agg[Aggregate metrics only]
    Ops --> BG[Break-glass: reason required, audit logged]
